    "detailed_description": "Assemble your crew and set sail across a perilous procedurally generated world. Traverse eight distinct biomes, each teeming with bizarre creatures and factions locked in a desperate struggle for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHunt deadly sea beasts for precious resources and barter with nearby factions for vital equipment and supplies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCommand your crew as they evolve, their traits shifting for better or worse as the voyage unfolds. Seek out and recruit new members from the mythical races dwelling upon the myriad islands you explore.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnhance your crew with potent elixirs brewed from the coveted gem horns of the whales they slay, bestowing upon them formidable abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForge alliances or wage war with the crews of rival factions. But heed this warning: your choices are remembered, and every decision bears a consequence.",
    "about_the_game": "Assemble your crew and set sail across a perilous procedurally generated world. Traverse eight distinct biomes, each teeming with bizarre creatures and factions locked in a desperate struggle for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHunt deadly sea beasts for precious resources and barter with nearby factions for vital equipment and supplies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCommand your crew as they evolve, their traits shifting for better or worse as the voyage unfolds. Seek out and recruit new members from the mythical races dwelling upon the myriad islands you explore.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnhance your crew with potent elixirs brewed from the coveted gem horns of the whales they slay, bestowing upon them formidable abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForge alliances or wage war with the crews of rival factions. But heed this warning: your choices are remembered, and every decision bears a consequence.",
    "short_description": "Set sail in a fantasy roguelike, exploring ever-shifting seas. Face monstrous leviathans, trade with cunning factions, and shape a diverse, evolving crew of mythical races. Each decision leaves its mark \u2014 forge your legend or be lost to the depths!",
